From: ossia SDK maintainers
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] corelib: include exception for std::terminate

Clang 23's libc++ no longer exposes std::terminate through the headers
included transitively by qexceptionhandling.h. Include its defining header
where the removed qTerminate() API calls it.
---
diff --git a/src/corelib/compat/removed_api.cpp b/src/corelib/compat/removed_api.cpp
--- a/src/corelib/compat/removed_api.cpp
+++ b/src/corelib/compat/removed_api.cpp
@@ -1250,6 +1250,7 @@
 #include "qchar.h" // inlined API
 
 
+#include <exception>
 #include "qexceptionhandling.h"
 
 QT_BEGIN_NAMESPACE
